TITLE TOY PASS FIXTURE

BLOCK R1 RCSTR
BLOCK C1 RADFRAC

FLOWSHEET
 BLOCK R1 IN=FEED OUT=RXOUT
 BLOCK C1 IN=RXOUT OUT=PROD WASTE

PROPERTIES

CALCULATOR CALC_FEED
 READ-VARS STREAM FEED MASS-FLOW
 WRITE-VARS BLOCK C1 DIST-RATE
 EXECUTE BEFORE BLOCK C1

DESIGN-SPEC DS_PROD
 SPEC 1 MASS-FRAC .995 COMPS=TARGET STREAMS=PROD
 VARY 1 MOLE-RR .2 20.0

SENSITIVITY S_R1VOL
